 Lumail Brand Guidelines and Logo Downloads Skip to content Lumail Product Agents Pricing Docs Changelog English ▼ Log in Sign up Brand Lumail brand guidelines How to write our name, use the logo, and pick colors, type and words when you talk about Lumail. Every file you need is below. Download all assets (.zip) Press contact Name Logo Colors Typography Voice Downloads 01 · Name Writing our name Lumail is one word with a capital L. Use Lumail.io only when you mean the website address. ✓ Lumail LuMail LUMAIL lumail Lu-mail Lumail.IO Lumail is a noun, never a verb: write “send it with Lumail”, not “lumail it”. Don’t translate it or add a possessive inside a headline. One-line description Copy Lumail is an email marketing platform that sends newsletters, automated sequences and transactional email from one domain, for creators, newsletter writers and SaaS founders. Press boilerplate Copy Lumail is an email marketing platform that sends newsletters, automated sequences and transactional email from one domain, for creators, newsletter writers and SaaS founders. Customers pay for the emails they send, not the subscribers they store, and can run the whole account from AI agents such as Claude Code, Codex and ChatGPT. Lumail is operated by Codelynx, LLC. 02 · Logo The logo A white L in a Flare rounded square, followed by the wordmark. Use the files as they are: they are drawn from the same source as the logo in our app. mark · radius 18/91 gap 26/91 Anatomy The tile is 91 units with an 18-unit corner radius. The gap to the wordmark is 26/91 of the mark’s height, and the wordmark’s cap height sits centered on the tile. ¼ mark Clear space Keep at least a quarter of the mark’s height empty on every side. Nothing else, including other logos, enters that space. 16 px 22 px tall Minimum size The mark works down to 16 px, our favicon size. Below 22 px tall, drop the wordmark and use the mark alone. Don’t change the logo ✕ Stretch or squash it ✕ Rotate it ✕ Recolor the tile ✕ Add shadows or effects ✕ Place it on Flare or busy color ✕ Fade or tint it Don’t redraw the L, set the wordmark in another font, or combine our logo with yours into a new lockup. Using the logo to refer to Lumail is fine; using it to suggest a partnership or endorsement needs our written approval. For “made with Lumail” credits, use the Lumail badge . 03 · Colors Colors Warm paper, near-black ink and one red. Flare does the work of pointing: the logo and a single filled action per view. It is never body text. Primary Click to copy Flare #FF3300 The logo tile and the one filled action per view. As text, large type only. RGB 255, 51, 0 --brand-flare Click to copy Ink #1A1614 Headlines, body copy and the wordmark on light backgrounds. RGB 26, 22, 20 --brand-ink Click to copy Paper #F8F7F4 The warm canvas behind every marketing page. RGB 248, 247, 244 --brand-paper Click to copy White #FFFFFF Cards, panels and the L inside the Flare tile. RGB 255, 255, 255 --card Support Click to copy Coral #F26A4B Highlighted words inside headlines. RGB 242, 106, 75 --marketing-coral Click to copy Peach #FFE3D9 Chips, pills and eyebrow labels. RGB 255, 227, 217 --marketing-lime Click to copy Wash #FBEEE7 Soft pads behind product mocks and callouts. RGB 251, 238, 231 --marketing-wash Click to copy Ember #C4320A Red text and icons on light backgrounds, where Flare is too light. RGB 196, 50, 10 --brand-accent Click to copy Void #08090A Dark surfaces and the dark app icon tile. RGB 8, 9, 10 --brand-void Contrast pairs Ink on Paper Body copy 16.8:1 AAA Ember on Paper Red text 5.1:1 AA White on Flare Buttons, logo 3.7:1 AA large Flare on Paper Large type only 3.4:1 AA large 04 · Typography Typography Three working typefaces and one reserved for the wordmark. All four are free on Google Fonts. Inter Headlines Google Fonts ↗ Import your list. Send tonight. Page titles and section headings. Regular weight, tight tracking, with character variants cv01–cv04 and ss03. Geist Interface and body Google Fonts ↗ You pay for emails sent, never for subscribers stored. Body copy, buttons, labels, tables and everything inside the product. Geist Mono Code and data Google Fonts ↗ lumail campaigns send --segment vip Code samples, API keys, IDs, terminal demos and small kicker labels. Plus Jakarta Sans Wordmark only Google Fonts ↗ Lumail SemiBold (600) at -3.4% tracking, used only for the word Lumail in the logo. Never for headlines or copy. 05 · Voice How we sound Minimal, precise and calm, like the product. We write for busy people who want to know what happens next. Direct Short sentences, second person, the verb first. Say what happens and what it costs. Precise Numbers beat adjectives. “40,000 emails for $20” instead of “generous limits”. Calm No hype words, no exclamation marks, no urgency tricks. Confident because it is specific. ✓ You pay for emails sent. Never for subscribers stored. ✕ Unlock unbeatable value with our revolutionary pricing! ✓ Import your list. Send tonight. ✕ Leverage our cutting-edge AI solution to supercharge your campaigns. ✓ Brevo starts multi-step workflows on Standard, from $18 a month. ✕ Unlike other tools, we don’t nickel-and-dime you. 06 · Downloads Logo files SVG for anything on screen or in print, PNG when a tool cannot take SVG. Text is outlined, so no font is needed. Logo Mark and wordmark. The default for light backgrounds. ↓ SVG ↓ PNG Logo, reversed White wordmark for dark backgrounds and photos. ↓ SVG ↓ PNG Mark App icon, avatars and anywhere the name is already visible. ↓ SVG ↓ PNG Mark, dark Flare L on Void, for dark app chrome and dark avatars. ↓ SVG ↓ PNG Wordmark The name alone, for tight horizontal spaces and credits. ↓ SVG ↓ PNG Symbol The bare L, one color, for tiny or monochrome uses. ↓ Black SVG ↓ White SVG Writing about Lumail? For interviews, screenshots or a logo format that is not here, email [email&#160;protected] . For numbers you can cite, see our email marketing statistics . Download all assets About Lumail Lumail Em
